    "estimated_logistics_cost_bdt": "Sum of per-transfer cost estimates (fixed BDT 150 + BDT 25/km).",
    "escalated_need_bdt": "Sum, over all decision points, of at-risk need that peer rebalancing could not cover (handed to distributor replenishment; the same agent can be counted at several decisions).",
